### ============================================================================
### PURCHASE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Manejo de compras de tokens GAPC

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@accessToken = your_jwt_token_here

### ============================================================================
### 1. GET /purchase/price - Get Current Token Price
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene el precio actual del token GAPC
### NO requiere autenticación

GET {{@api}}/purchase/price

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "price": 0.15,
###   "currency": "usd",
###   "source": "coingecko",
###   "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
### }


### ============================================================================
### 2. POST /purchase/initiate - Initiate Purchase
### ============================================================================
### Inicia una nueva compra de tokens
### Pasos:
### 1. Llamar este endpoint con cantidad SOL
### 2. Obtener transactionBase64 para firmar
### 3. Firmar con wallet
### 4. Confirmar compra

POST {{@api}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "walletAddress": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "paymentMethodId": "solana",
  "solAmount": 0.5,
  "slippageTolerance": 0.05
}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "transactionId": "tx_12345",
###   "transactionBase64": "AQAAA...",
###   "estimatedTokens": 3.33,
###   "totalCost": 0.5
### }


### ============================================================================
### 3. POST /purchase/confirm/:transactionId - Confirm Purchase
### ============================================================================
### Confirma una compra después de firmarla
### :transactionId = ID retornado por /initiate

POST {{@api}}/purchase/confirm/tx_12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "transactionHash": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Compra confirmada",
###   "tokensMinted": 3.33,
###   "transactionHash": "..."
### }


### ============================================================================
### 4. GET /purchase/status/:transactionId - Check Purchase Status
### ============================================================================
### Verifica el estado de una compra en progreso

GET {{@api}}/purchase/status/tx_12345

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "status": "confirmed",
###   "tokens": 3.33,
###   "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
### }


### ============================================================================
### 5. GET /purchase/history/:walletAddress - Get Purchase History
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene histórico de compras de un wallet
### :walletAddress = Dirección Solana

GET {{@api}}/purchase/history/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

### Response should be 200 OK with array of transactions


### ============================================================================
### 6. GET /purchase/payment-methods - Get Available Payment Methods
### ============================================================================
### Lista métodos de pago disponibles

GET {{@api}}/purchase/payment-methods

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "methods": [
###     {
###       "id": "solana",
###       "name": "Solana",
###       "symbol": "SOL",
###       "icon": "..."
###     },
###     ...
###   ]
### }


### ============================================================================
### 7. GET /purchase/market-stats - Get Market Statistics
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene estadísticas del mercado

GET {{@api}}/purchase/market-stats

